## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical application of offline convolutive ICA under realistic, moving-room conditions with mismatched mixing, a common beginner challenge. It also probes pre-processing choices, permutation strategies, and evaluation with ground-truth data.

## Key Concepts
- Convolutive ICA under nonstationary mixing
- Pre-processing for drifting room acoustics
- Batch vs joint-diagonalization ICA across frequency bins
- Cross-bin permutation consistency and drift handling
- SDR/SIR-based evaluation with synthetic ground truth

